 libunity-core-6.0-9 - core library for the Unity interface
 libunity-core-6.0-dev - Core library for the Unity interface - development files
 unity      - Interface designed for efficiency of space and interaction.
 unity-autopilot - Autopiloted tests for Unity
 unity-schemas - Interface designed for efficiency of space and interaction.
 unity-services - Services for the Unity interface
 unity-uwidgets - Widgets for Unity
Changes:
 unity (7.7.1+26.04.20260306-0ubuntu3+unity13) resolute; urgency=medium
 .
   * lockscreen: org.gnome.ScreenSaver GetActive now answers true while the
     session is locked, not only while the screen is blanked, and
     ActiveChanged is sent when that combined value changes, once per change.
   * session: report the lock to logind (SetLockedHint) while Unity's own
     lockscreen is the session's locker. In legacy mode (screen reader or
     on-screen keyboard enabled) the hint is left to the other locker; a
     "locked" hint Unity set before such a switch is cleared on unlock.
